/T (Quality measures: MSE and the PSNR which are derived from it are simple to calculate but do not consider image structure. Wang et al. introduced the structural similarity index \(SSIM\), which compares local luminance, contrast and structure which is closer to human judgement [10]. We report both, since a method can improve one without the other.)
/E (Quality measures: MSE and the PSNR which are derived from it are simple to calculate but do not consider image structure. Wang et al. introduced the structural similarity index \(SSIM\), which compares local luminance, contrast and structure which is closer to human judgement [10]. We report both, since a method can improve one without the other.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [12]
>>
