/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 39 0 R
/T (We compared three families of image denoisers on Fashion-MNIST under Gaussian and salt-and-pepper noise, and no single method won everywhere. A tuned bilateral filter gives the best PSNR for mild Gaussian noise, the median filter is the best classical option for impulses, and a compact 66,593-parameter CDAE trained on mixed noise gives the best SSIM in every condition and the best PSNR for strong )
/E (We compared three families of image denoisers on Fashion-MNIST under Gaussian and salt-and-pepper noise, and no single method won everywhere. A tuned bilateral filter gives the best PSNR for mild Gaussian noise, the median filter is the best classical option for impulses, and a compact 66,593-parameter CDAE trained on mixed noise gives the best SSIM in every condition and the best PSNR for strong )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [10]
