/Title (We compared three families of image denoisers on Fashion-MNIST under Gaussian and salt-and-pepper noise, and no single method won everywhere. A tuned bilateral filter gives the best PSNR for mild Gaussian noise, the median filter is the best classical option for impulses, and a compact 66,593-parameter CDAE trained on mixed noise gives the best SSIM in every condition and the best PSNR for strong)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 434 0 R
/Next 459 0 R
>>
endobj
