<<
/Title (Everything ran on a multi-core CPU workstation with Python 3.12, PyTorch 2.11, OpenCV 5.0 and scikit-learn 1.8, and no GPU. CDAE training took 123.4 s. The training loss fell from 0.0393 to 0.0052 and the validation loss from 0.0119 to 0.0054 over the ten epochs \(Fig. 5\), and the two curves stayed close together. Fitting PCA took 0.45 s.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 444 0 R
/Prev 457 0 R
/Next 476 0 R
>>
endobj
